{"version":1,"content":"<p>TCL CSOT（華星光電）在DTC 2026展會上展示了一款面向筆記本電腦的超低功耗顯示面板。這塊14英寸IPS LCD原型屏在聯想Yoga Pro筆記本原型機中亮相，據稱功耗最低可降至1瓦，為輕薄本和長續航流動裝置提供了新的顯示技術方向。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587756.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:03:56.198263+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:44:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_hash":"e23b9836bd0481369f6823b4714dc519f04f433a14a0a4805a247d65669a49e1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}